				</span></i>
			; of the object of a dedication, as in titles of hymns,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινίκια</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in regard to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῶτος εἰς εὐψυχίαν</span>”
