					774b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.55
			</span></i>; 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ ἄλλα</span> Th.I.I; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄπαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					489
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ πάνθ᾽ ὁμῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					736
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς μὲν ταῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					210a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τό γ᾽ εἰς ἑαυτόν, τὸ εἰς ἐμέ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				706
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				691
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				346
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ὀλίγους μᾶλλον τὰς ἀρχὰς ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς πλείονας οἰκεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
